      "note": "Every checkpoint is a Qwen3_5ForConditionalGeneration VLM with a vision tower and an MTP head in its safetensors. Extraction loads Qwen3_5ForCausalLM, the text decoder alone, so params_b_from_weights counts the text tensors from the safetensors headers (vision and MTP excluded, a tied embedding counted once); weight_bytes stays the full download. Layers are 3:1 Gated-DeltaNet:softmax, so a layer index is not a position in a homogeneous stack. The template's thinking default differs inside the ladder (0.8B/2B default off, 4B+ default on), so both levels are rendered with enable_thinking set explicitly and neither ends at the bare assistant tag."
